    behavioral_synastry: `The Uranus-bearer's natural mode of disruption arrives at the Sun-bearer's identity as ongoing pressure to wake up, change, individuate, throw off whatever conventions are constraining authentic expression. This can land as liberating clarity or as destabilizing volatility, depending on whether the Sun-bearer's identity was actually ready to shift in the directions the Uranus-bearer activates. The Sun-bearer's vitality registers in the Uranus-bearer's awareness as worth electrifying — the Uranus-bearer rarely encounters the Sun-bearer with neutral curiosity. The bond produces real change in both chart-bearers, and the change is rarely small. The work is making sure the awakening serves both rather than tearing apart things the Sun-bearer was actually content with.`,
